The implementation table is in place. The first build exposed only proof-engineering issues: a fuel variable typo in decimal conversion, a termination obligation in tokenization, and simplifier blow-up from unfolding the full dispatcher. I’ve corrected the recursion and isolated theorem-path rewrite lemmas so Lean can prove the target without expanding thousands of irrelevant dispatcher branches.
